    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While adventuring with your wife, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you and the hired warrior Bob become trapped in a Succubus's tomb. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After accidentally awakening the Succubus Queen, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you're forced to complete eight trials of lust. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the effects of lust poison and the trials, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >will your wife remain faithful to you with your help, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or will she be taken by another man under your influence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Game Features:</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fully Animated H-Scenes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total of 50+ sex scenes are all animation </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(excluding daily mini-events with cute pictures)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two route</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full route for both NTR and love route</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both routes feature plenty of daily events with cute pictures </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >that include interactions with your wife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and Research Tree (No Combat)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist your wife in maintaining her sanity through research and alchemy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Materials for research can be gathered through exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Outfits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various outfits for your wife will have different effects and unlock new scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to love and NTR endings, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there are also normal bad endings and research endings, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with branching paths influenced by the research points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gallery Room</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >which includes a system to unlock every erotic scene.</p>",
